{"id":"n50517-1-7","stage":4,"title":"딸리다 · 附属","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50517-1-7-1","ko":"해외에서 상을 받았다는 영화 봤어요?","zh":"你看过那部说在国外获奖的电影吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"해외에서","meaning":"海外，国外","explanation":"해외：海外，国外；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"해외","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62481","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상을","meaning":"奖，奖赏","explanation":"상：奖，奖赏；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"상","audio":"/audio/3c2d6ddb4a94f1f36375.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62113","senseId":"1","lemma":"상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받았다는","meaning":"取得，获得","explanation":"받다：取得，获得；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"4","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤어요?","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"82862092ebbd4ef9","term":"해외","zh":"海外，国外","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3","entryId":"62481","definition":"不是自己国家，别的国家。","pronunciation":["해ː외","해ː웨"]},{"id":"3c2d6ddb4a94f1f3","term":"상","zh":"奖，奖赏","audio":"/audio/3c2d6ddb4a94f1f36375.mp3","entryId":"62113","definition":"为表扬做的好事或优秀的成绩而给的东西。","pronunciation":["상"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"取得，获得","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"得到分数或学位等。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e28b2d85dcf381effe8f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n50517-1-7-2","ko":"아니요, 애가 딸려서 영화관 가는 것도 쉽지 않네요.","zh":"没有，因为带着孩子，去电影院也不容易呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요,","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"애가","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"애：孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"2","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"딸려서","meaning":"附属，附带","explanation":"딸리다：附属，附带；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"딸리다","audio":"/audio/67f2d0b430c90fad3dfe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50517","senseId":"1","lemma":"딸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영화관","meaning":"电影院","explanation":"영화관：电影院","readings":[{"term":"영화관","audio":"/audio/92cd07820110f1fb867a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14113","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가는","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것도","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉽지","meaning":"容易","explanation":"쉽다：容易；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"쉽다","audio":"/audio/a39c0e9196a70295a55f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66314","senseId":"3","lemma":"쉽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않네요.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"(谦词)自己的小孩。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"67f2d0b430c90fad","term":"딸리다","zh":"附属，附带","audio":"/audio/67f2d0b430c90fad3dfe.mp3","entryId":"50517","definition":"挂或粘在某物上。","pronunciation":["딸리다"]},{"id":"92cd07820110f1fb","term":"영화관","zh":"电影院","audio":"/audio/92cd07820110f1fb867a.mp3","entryId":"14113","definition":"配备放映电影的设施，并能够使公众欣赏电影的地方。","pronunciation":["영화관"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"a39c0e9196a70295","term":"쉽다","zh":"容易","audio":"/audio/a39c0e9196a70295a55f.mp3","entryId":"66314","definition":"有很大可能性。","pronunciation":["쉽ː따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/e0899d70d2ca3c586c38.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.117,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=50517","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":148,"sequenceScore":2.9437,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没有，因为带着孩子，去电影院也不容易呢。","事故是怎么发生的呢？","你看过那部说在国外获奖的电影吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["没有，因为带着孩子，去电影院也不容易呢。","你看过那部说在国外获奖的电影吗？","事故是怎么发生的呢？"],"answer":0}]}
